  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 177B NVFP4(119GiB): SSD streaming at 9-10 tok/s on one 16 GB RTX 5060 Ti + 32 GB RAM",
  "sourceBodyHash": "4fb7c1b947aa675a4f393d99574ec9f1d4d1afb452c86ebf8039aeaeb7bf05fe",
