  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 28,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a47ed312db4ea11",
      "translationZh": "我们构建了一个用于不适合放入显存和内存的 MoE 模型的推理引擎。大部分模型驻留在 SSD 上，专家在需要时按 token 读取。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80d69c3ebf8fabaa",
      "translationZh": "这最初是一个概念验证，验证工作成功，我们在 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next NVFP4 上实现了 9-10 token/秒的解码速度（基准测试时为 9.06，最佳情况下为 10.4）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4a0855f6725e3ab",
      "translationZh": "这仅仅是开始。随着 SSD 流式传输的改进，我们预计 v2 能达到约 14-15 token/秒的解码速度。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b758f471e7dd128a",
      "translationZh": "模型：Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，176.9B 参数，NVFP4 GGUF（119 GiB）：https://huggingface.co/CompiledThoughts/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4-Q8_0",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7544d50fd71116a1",
      "translationZh": "机器：RTX 5060 Ti 16 GB，Ryzen 7 9700X，32 GB DDR5，Gen5 NVMe SSD 1 TB，Windows 11",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a6fe586ba42129c",
      "translationZh": "文件大小的那一部分",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e8b184f87313406",
      "translationZh": "稠密权重（注意力、共享专家、语言模型头）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a5fecbff7b869ea",
      "translationZh": "RAM，每个 token 读取一行",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6780691b205f0dfd",
      "translationZh": "下一个最热门的路由专家",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dca3ba9dcc13635",
      "translationZh": "剩余的路由专家",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63cb0d308244cfbf",
      "translationZh": "SSD，每个 token 读取 16 行",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d9811df39353948",
      "translationZh": "因此 20 GiB 位于内存中，99 GiB 保持在 SSD 上：48.5 GiB 的路由专家被流式传输，路由器挑选它们；以及 50.7 GiB 的哈希 n‑gram 表（期待 qwen4 ngram）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5cbedbc403fe506",
      "translationZh": "解码：基准回合每秒 9.06 token，最高回合每秒 10.4 token（高强度）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d90efeab87538ff1",
      "translationZh": "预填充：在 5.5k token 提示下每秒 49.2 token",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f799c13bf967e4ba",
      "translationZh": "在同一机器上运行 llama.cpp 时，平均解码速度为每秒 4.9 token",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4a8b8deef7d4721",
      "translationZh": "显存（VRAM）存放密集权重和最活跃的专家（GCLOCK 驱逐），固定内存（pinned RAM）作为下一层（通过 PCIe 读取），其余数据通过 8 条读取线程从 NVMe 读取",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d914d3c3b42e289",
      "translationZh": "Lookahead 预取会猜测下一层的专家并提前开始读取它们。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db57272c88808632",
      "translationZh": "NVFP4 矩阵乘法在张量核心上运行 FP4 × FP4，且无需先进行解包。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d34a0be5faca17d",
      "translationZh": "每个 token 大约会从 SSD 读取 270 MiB，且约 75% 的专家查找命中内存。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8ff2752c0d08060",
      "translationZh": "每个 token 使用 480 位专家（每层 48 层中各 10 位）。其中约 377 位已在 VRAM 或 RAM 中，其余约 103 位需从 SSD 读取，约为每 token 270 MiB。正是这种命中率使我们能够达到 9 tps。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71255b441f10e1a6",
      "translationZh": "它只从 SSD 读取，几乎不写入，因此 SSD 的写入磨损应当极小。但我们在长时间运行时看到 SSD 温度升至 70°C。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07bd46ca75ad3f88",
      "translationZh": "还支持：Qwen3.6-35B-A3B NVFP4。它可以放入显存+内存中。你也可以通过 SSD 流式传输运行它，这也是本工作学习曲线的一部分。在同一台机器上使用调优配置时，它的性能为：约 4k 上下文时解码速率 47.3 tok/s，预填充速率 591 tok/s。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d56553f20c1c7ddc",
      "translationZh": "服务端：一个兼容 OpenAI 的服务器，渲染模型自带的聊天模板，支持工具调用（仍有 bug，已在 Cline 上测试），将推理过程从答案中分离出来，并内置聊天页面。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a5977d921ec762",
      "translationZh": "v1 的限制：仅限 RTX 50 系列 / Blackwell（sm_120）显卡，仅在 Windows 11 和 WSL2 上测试，且仅支持贪婪解码。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f48d4d98d5fad67a",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/compiledthoughts/Inferred-Thoughts",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0936646a41dd9ec1",
      "translationZh": "所有模型：https://huggingface.co/CompiledThoughts",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0195903353b7c040",
      "translationZh": "欢迎提出问题和反馈，尤其是那些在小卡上运行大型 MoE（混合专家模型）的人。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
